# Per-window input method hints for fcitx5-chatlang (copy to chatlang-map).
# <window class><TAB><title substring or *><TAB><input method>, first match wins.
# The title substring is matched against the window title, so a Telegram chat
# name selects the input method for that friend before you type anything.
#org.telegram.desktop	SomeJapaneseFriend	mozc
#org.telegram.desktop	SomeEnglishFriend	keyboard-us
#org.telegram.desktop	*	pinyin
